---
---

<section class="section" id="about" aria-labelledby="about-title">
  <div class="section-inner">
    <p class="eyebrow"><span class="path">/about</span></p>
    <h2 id="about-title" data-entrance>Fast, private, simple.</h2>

    <div class="about-editorial">
      <p class="about-lede text-ink" data-reveal>
        I build software that respects your machine and your data.
      </p>

      <p class="about-body" data-reveal>
        I don't just use technology. I like understanding how it works
        underneath, building my own mental model of it, and documenting
        what I learn.
      </p>

      <p class="about-emphasis" data-trigger-highlight data-reveal>
        Every millisecond matters, | local-first by default, | fewer moving parts.
      </p>

      <ul class="about-principles" data-reveal>
        <li>
          <span class="principle-name text-ink">Performance.</span>
          <span>Every millisecond matters. I profile, measure and cut what isn't needed.</span>
        </li>
        <li>
          <span class="principle-name text-ink">Privacy.</span>
          <span>Local-first by default. Your data stays on your device, not in a cloud dashboard.</span>
        </li>
        <li>
          <span class="principle-name text-ink">Simplicity.</span>
          <span>Fewer moving parts. Interfaces that don't need a manual to understand.</span>
        </li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .about-editorial {
    margin-top: var(--space-xl);
    max-width: 44rem;
  }

  .about-lede {
    font-size: clamp(1.4rem, 2.6vw, 1.9rem);
    line-height: 1.3;
    letter-spacing: -0.015em;
    font-weight: 650;
    max-width: 28ch;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .about-body {
    margin-top: var(--space-lg);
    font-size: var(--step-0);
    line-height: 1.7;
    max-width: 52ch;
  }

  /* Subtle viewport-triggered emphasis: three short phrases sit muted,
     each locks to full ink as it crosses the middle band. Stays lit. */
  .about-emphasis {
    margin-top: var(--space-xl);
    font-size: clamp(1.15rem, 2.2vw, 1.45rem);
    line-height: 1.45;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    max-width: 32ch;
    padding-top: var(--space-lg);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
  }

  .about-principles {
    margin-top: var(--space-xl);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
  }

  .about-principles li {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 9rem 1fr;
    gap: 1rem;
    padding: 1rem 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
    color: var(--ink-dim);
    line-height: 1.6;
    font-size: var(--step-0);
  }

  .principle-name { font-weight: 650; }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .about-principles li {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 0.15rem;
    }
    .about-lede { max-width: 100%; }
  }
</style>
